    "data": {
      "id": 2635,
      "hub_id": null,
      "guid": "com.fiodor.smoothtalker",
      "name": "Smooth Talker",
      "slug": "smooth-talker",
      "teaser": "Today your PMC could be as dumb as yesterday but a little more talkative.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/BPxt0E5QOT9PzGEGfttsrNWbwXq37M4fHKwsfhd0.png",
      "downloads": 10662,
      "favourites_count": 42,
      "description": "<p>If your flatmates/special one are tired of you yelling “Grenade!”, “One down!” or “Reloading!” then this is the mod for you.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>What does it do ?:</h2>\n<p>Heavily inspired by <strong>ssh’s VocalPlayer</strong>, this mod autoplays voicelines when your PMC performs specific actions like :</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Killing a PMC</li>\n<li>Killing a Scav</li>\n<li>Being shot at</li>\n<li>Reloading</li>\n<li>Throwing a grenade</li>\n<li>Firing with an empty chamber</li>\n<li>Pinging close to one of your team mates’ ping plays a confirmation voiceline</li>\n<li>Pinging an enemy plays a Spotted voiceline</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h2>Customizable:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Cooldown between voicelines</li>\n<li>What voicelines to play</li>\n<li>Delay between kill and confirming the kill</li>\n<li>Schizo mode if you’d like to talk to yourself or multiplayer only if you’re more of the social type</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>TIP: Use the empty chamber setting to test the voicelines in the hideout</strong></p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Installation:</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Open the downloaded zip file.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Drag the BepInEx folder from the zip file into your SPT folder.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Support:</h2>\n<p>Discord thread in the SPT discord : <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/875684761291599922/1482076311903146054\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://discord.com/channels/875684761291599922/1482076311903146054</a></p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Thanks:</h2>\n<p>ssh for his original mod and the permission to upload mine on the Forge.<br />\nDrakia for the original gif.<br />\nIllustration is talkative by Daria Szymonowicz from Noun Project (CC BY 3.0)</p>\n<hr />\n<h1>Disclaimer:</h1>\n<p>After having thought about it for a while I’m going to retire from modding for the time being.</p>\n<p>I’m relying way too much on AI to do most of the heavy work. Whenever I see AI art I can’t stop myself from being disgusted by it and I’ve come to feel the same way about AI mods.\nHence why I’ve decided to stop modding altogether and dedicate the free time I have to learn C# and Unity.</p>\n<p>The only thing I’ll keep updated will be the per-scope config for PiP-Disabler.</p>\n<p>If anyone wants to maintain my mods they’re free to do so !\nAlthough PiP-Disabler is an absolute mess and would probably need to be rewritten from the ground up to be maintainable…</p>\n",
      "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2635/smooth-talker",
      "fika_compatibility": true,
      "featured": false,
      "contains_ads": false,
      "contains_ai_content": true,
      "custom_ai_disclosure": "<p>AI was used to explore the Tarkov decompiled assembly and find the relevant methods to patch.<br />\nAlso to help with Fika ping integration.</p>\n",
